    "control": "DIVE_DISABLE_NATIVE_SUCCESSORS=1 selects the ordinary generator in the same executable. For separate coverage rows, DIVE_NATIVE_SUCCESSOR_METER names a fresh file receiving power-of-two dispatch counters.",
