    "order": "For each source stage, independently time prepare, a fresh emitted-worker search and a separate peer invocation. Extra instrumented and exact controls followed the cold rows. Transfer holdouts use on/off in alternating new processes.",
    "sail": "sail runtime execute --cache PRIVATE_SAIL_CACHE --file -; version 1 temporal.check original files + cfg, max_states=600000, max_depth=1000, wall_time_ms=120000. One untouched stock Sail worker and private response cache.",
    "negative": "Compile three edited negative models in nominal mode. Compare exact stock and emitted check at workers 1/8; re-run dive validate-trace on original source with both word and damaged initial state."
  },
