    "original": "449595 distinct, 1954072 generated, depth 33. Prepare misses build the model-specific executable; prepare hits recompile the original TLA+ to an in-memory Core plan and compare its control shape before selecting the previously built executable. Every check then reparses the current source and searches its graph again.",
    "edit": "The changed invariant and changed reachable guard retained the same emitted control shape. Both used the unchanged executable with fresh actual Core expression nodes and fresh runtime values, independently matching pinned peer counts.",
    "standing": "The source-driven tool overtook the peer after the property edit but did not beat unchanged warm or growth wall time. The stock checker remains the inexpensive first-run path. #1314 remains open.",
    "experimental_rejections": "Generic projected whole-branch or second-opcode-loop plans were not promoted: early p99 throughput work must not turn a cache hit rate into a wall-time claim. Explore nested actor-record value lowering in #1363.",
